# 1. Brainstorming & Ideation Phase
**Project Name:** EduGenie - Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## Problem Statement
Students across different academic levels often struggle with understanding complex theoretical concepts, revising long educational passages, testing their understanding efficiently, or finding structured learning paths tailored to their pace.

## Proposed Solution
EduGenie is an all-in-one AI-powered learning assistant that bridges educational gaps by leveraging generative AI. It offers simplified concept explanations, dynamic Q&A, automated quiz generation, text summarization, and step-by-step learning roadmaps in an easy-to-use web interface.

## Core Features & Objectives
* **Instant Q&A:** Fast resolution of academic queries.
* **Concept Simplification:** Step-by-step breakdown of complex subjects using lightweight AI.
* **Smart Summarization:** Rapid conversion of long passages into key revision points.
* **Quiz Generation:** Instant conversion of passages into multiple-choice questions (MCQs).
* **Learning Roadmaps:** Guided learning paths organized from beginner to advanced levels.

